#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of AI skills for Qiskit quantum computing workflows."
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan kemahiran AI untuk aliran kerja pengkomputeran kuantum Qiskit."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills"
msgstr "Kemahiran AI Qiskit"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Kemahiran AI Qiskit {#qiskit-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr "[Repositori kemahiran AI Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) mempunyai satu set kemahiran yang boleh anda gunakan dengan pembantu AI, seperti Bob, Claude, atau ChatGPT. Kemahiran AI ialah satu set arahan boleh guna semula yang mengajar pembantu tersebut cara menyelesaikan tugas tertentu.  Kemahiran boleh membantu menjimatkan masa dan memastikan tugas berulang dilakukan secara konsisten dan betul.  \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first available skill is `migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime`, for migrating `qiskit-ibm-runtime` code.\n"
msgstr "Kemahiran pertama yang tersedia ialah `migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime`, untuk memigrasikan kod `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan kemahiran AI Qiskit, ikut arahan untuk pembantu AI anda.  Secara umum, anda hanya perlu memberikan kemahiran tersebut kepada pembantu, kemudian beritahu di mana hendak menggunakan kemahiran tersebut.\n"
